Cell["\<\
\[LineSeparator]Next, set construct the interior solution basis.  If we wish \
to do this and loop over energy, then we need a loop over the following body \
of \[LineSeparator]code:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.703440647880804*^9, 3.703440732620159*^9}, 
   3.703520851964891*^9, 3.7035209060505753`*^9}],

